== Roles ==
viewer      2 perms (own 2, inherited 0)
commenter   3 perms (own 1, inherited 2)
editor      5 perms (own 2, inherited 3)
publisher   6 perms (own 1, inherited 5)
auditor     3 perms (own 1, inherited 2)
admin       9 perms (own 2, inherited 7)
== Users ==
alice: comment.read comment.write doc.create doc.publish doc.read doc.write log.read role.manage user.manage
bob: comment.read doc.create doc.read doc.write log.read
carol: comment.read comment.write doc.read
dan: comment.read comment.write doc.create doc.read doc.write
== Who can... ==
doc.publish    alice
log.read       alice, bob
comment.write  alice, carol, dan
user.delete    (nobody)
== Comparisons ==
bob only: log.read
dan only: comment.write
carol within bob? false
alice strictly above dan? true
bob and carol disjoint? false
roles granting nothing in use: none
areas: comment(2) doc(4) log(1) role(1) user(1)
== Bad configurations ==
editor: cycle through editor (editor > commenter > viewer > admin > publisher > editor)
guest: missing role 'visitor'
auditor: cycle through viewer (auditor > viewer > admin > publisher > editor > commenter > viewer)
